# Never commit prod-filesystem inventories or manifest artifacts.
# Spec ref: v1.1 §0.5 — "Manifests and prod-filesystem inventories are NEVER published."
# Created 2026-07-29 during audit run A, Session 2 pre-step.

manifest_*
*_paths.txt
*_hashed.txt

# Session working scratch — full command outputs may contain paths, sizes,
# and other reconnaissance material. Findings YAML and summary docs may quote
# individual paths as evidence; raw dumps stay local.
exec/

# Snapshots of uncommitted prod scripts / configs. Even after redaction, better
# to keep local — prod scripts often embed hostnames, ports, table names, and
# other reconnaissance material we don't want in a public repo.
snapshots/
